IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `oas-core`
IMPORT `oas-core-measures`
IMPORT `oas-core-periods`
IMPORT `oa2-part2-eligibility`
IMPORT `oa2-part3-amount`
IMPORT `oa2-part3-spouse-allowance`

-- Tests of oa2-part3-spouse-allowance: sections 19 and 20. Every expected value is worked out by hand from the words
-- of the section, with the reasoning in the comment. The base case is a spouse born March 15, 1960 asking about
-- September 2022: 62 on August 31, 2022; not separated; 25 years of residence; a citizen; a joint application made
-- and approved; nothing against payment. Each test changes only what it names.
-- The month in which paragraph 19(6)(e) comes into force is not in the text: July 2000 is a made-up value for the tests.

`test base facts` MEANS `s 19: Facts about a person who may be paid an allowance and a month` WITH
    `the relation of the person to the pensioner` IS `Spouse`
    `the person is separated from the pensioner` IS FALSE
    `the sole reason for the separation is that one of the partners is an incarcerated person described in subsection 5(3) or paragraph 19(6)(f)` IS FALSE
    `the sole reason for the separation is that the pensioner is an incarcerated person described in subsection 5(3)` IS FALSE
    `the day on which the separation commenced` IS NOTHING
    `the person's date of birth` IS YMD 1960 3 15
    `the aggregate period of residence in Canada after attaining eighteen years of age and prior to the day on which the application is approved, in years` IS 25
    `the person was resident in Canada on the day preceding the day on which the application is approved` IS TRUE
    `on the day preceding the day on which the application for an allowance is approved the person is a Canadian citizen` IS TRUE
    `on the day preceding the day on which the application for an allowance is approved the person is legally resident in Canada` IS TRUE
    `on the day preceding the day the person ceased to reside in Canada the person was a Canadian citizen` IS FALSE
    `on the day preceding the day the person ceased to reside in Canada the person was legally resident in Canada` IS FALSE
    `a joint application of the pensioner and the person has been made for the payment period` IS TRUE
    `an application described in section 30 has been made` IS FALSE
    `the pensioner is an incarcerated person described in subsection 5(3) and the person has applied individually` IS FALSE
    `payment of the allowance has been approved under this Part` IS TRUE
    `the requirement for an application has been waived under subsection 19(4.1)` IS FALSE
    `the month in which the application is received or is deemed to have been made or in which the requirement for an application has been waived` IS YMD 2022 9 1
    `no supplement may be paid to the pensioner for the month` IS FALSE
    `a supplement would be payable to the pensioner for the month if the pensioner's special qualifying factor were equal to one` IS FALSE
    `a supplement would be payable to the pensioner for the month if the pensioner were not precluded from receiving a supplement by subsection 5(3)` IS FALSE
    `the person is absent from Canada throughout the month` IS FALSE
    `the month in which the person left Canada` IS NOTHING
    `the person has remained outside Canada since leaving` IS FALSE
    `an undertaking by a sponsor is in effect in respect of the person` IS FALSE
    `the person was qualified to receive an allowance immediately before the day on which paragraph 19(6)(d) came into force` IS FALSE
    `an event as provided by the regulations has occurred` IS FALSE
    `the person is a common-law partner who was not a spouse immediately before the coming into force of paragraph 19(6)(e)` IS FALSE
    `the month in which paragraph 19(6)(e) comes into force` IS YMD 2000 7 1
    `the sentence of imprisonment the person is subject to` IS NOTHING
    `the first day of the period of incarceration` IS NOTHING
    `the month in which the person is released` IS NOTHING
    `the person has notified the Minister in writing before or after the release` IS FALSE
    `the month in which the person dies` IS NOTHING
    `the month in which the person becomes the spouse or common-law partner of another person` IS NOTHING

