#ASSERT NOT `s 19(1)(b): the person is at least sixty and under sixty-five` (YMD 2025 5 15) `test facts where the person's date of birth is YMD 1960 4 1`
-- (1)(c): 25 years: met. 10 years and resident the day before: met; not resident: not met. 9.99: not met. 19.99 and not
